        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 269604,
            "end": 332511,
            "text": "Sounds good, let's get started."
          },
          {
            "start": 332512,
            "end": 368458,
            "text": "Let me know which item you would like to prioritize first."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-05",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 377445,
            "end": 404405,
            "text": "We put together a short list of items for today's call."
          },
          {
            "start": 404406,
            "end": 458326,
            "text": "Nothing urgent overall, just a short list we wanted to get through."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 476300,
            "end": 503260,
            "text": "Sounds good, I have some time blocked so we can cover everything."
          },
          {
            "start": 503261,
            "end": 584141,
            "text": "Happy to go through whatever is on your list today."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-05",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 611101,
            "end": 691982,
            "text": "Every few weeks a batch of transactions shows up twice in the ledger after the sync runs, and finance has to hunt down which one to remove."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-05",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 709956,
            "end": 799824,
            "text": "Our July close had 9 duplicate entries come through, adding up to roughly 4,300 dollars our bookkeeper had to back out."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 808811,
            "end": 889692,
            "text": "Appreciate you walking through that, quick question on my end."
          },
          {
            "start": 889693,
            "end": 916652,
            "text": "Can you tell me which close date that was and roughly how many entries were affected?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-05",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 943612,
            "end": 961586,
            "text": "It was the July 31st close, 9 entries, each one duplicated once."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 988546,
            "end": 1033480,
            "text": "Good, let's shift gears for a minute, anything else worth mentioning?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-05",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1042467,
            "end": 1105374,
            "text": "We are training a backup person in case someone is out."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1132335,
            "end": 1141322,
            "text": "Happy to help however is useful for the newer staff."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-05",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1150308,
            "end": 1159295,
            "text": "We are a little ahead of where we were on renewals last year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1186256,
            "end": 1249163,
            "text": "That timing lines up with what we typically see this time of year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-05",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1258150,
            "end": 1285110,
            "text": "We try to run a refresher training every few months."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1294097,
            "end": 1339031,
            "text": "Good on you for prioritizing training even when things are busy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-05",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1365991,
            "end": 1446872,
            "text": "We are keeping an eye on a handful of accounts that have not renewed yet."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
